  "summary": {
    "en": [
      "Judge Ray Pianka centered his career on public service, neighborhood fairness, and Cleveland housing. After organizing Detroit-Shoreway residents and helping start the community development organization there, he became a key figure in preservation and redevelopment, helped save the Gordon Square Arcade, and brought Polish-rooted civic values to Housing Court leadership."
    ]
